On verdicts
-----------

Both absorbed specs forbid the same verdict in the same words: this app does not decide whether a
claim is true, and it does not judge the person who wrote it. There is no truth field in the engine,
no author rating, and no score. The technique list is a fixed list of eleven patterns, each with a
reason; a flag names the technique and quotes the sentence so the reader can disagree with it. An
empty flag list is only ever produced for text that was actually read — text that was not read
returns no list at all, because an empty list would read as a verdict.
